Z||000000||bcwawright||07-19-2001||02:24 PM||||I have just purchased a new 3800 SeriesII Supercharged engine and I want to modify it. I know Chris West and Thrasher make accessories for this engine but I am wondering if there are any other reputabile companies that offer high performance upgrades for this engine.<BR>Thanks for any help.<P>Bruce<BR>88GT||||reg||5
Z||000001||Formula88||07-19-2001||03:18 PM||||Ram Air Technologies. <A HREF="http://www.ramairtech.com" TARGET=_blank>www.ramairtech.com</A> <P>They race their cars to prove the performance.  They've run a Grand Prix GTP 4-door for a 12 second quarter mile with their add ons.  They've also been featured in High Performance Pontiac Magazine.  I hear they can take forever to ship, though, so caveat emptor.  Check out any Grand Prix sites you can find.  Lots of enthusiasts there.  There should be a link to one, or several, from <A HREF="http://www.grandamgt.com" TARGET=_blank>www.grandamgt.com</A>  .  The webmaster of that site is also a GTP fan.||||reg||4
